  "notes": "Two columns in 314.05: 'Allowed Fee' (recorded as adult, members 21+) and 'Allowed Fee (EPSDT-eligible members)' (recorded as child, under 21). Rates apply to dates of service on or after June 1, 2024; still the regulation in force on 2026-10-20 (amendments heard 2026-08-07 only add bundled limited-ortho rates from 2027-01-01, other rates unchanged). Administrative Bulletin 26-12 (eff. 2026-01-01, https://www.mass.gov/files/documents/2026/05/08/ab-26-12.pdf) only revises descriptors of D9222/D9223/D9230/D9239/D9243, no rate change; AB 26-06 (CDT 2025) touches none of the target codes. I.C. (individual consideration) codes listed under by_report: D6245, D6740, D7953, D8070, D8090. Mixed: D5225 adult I.C.; D5226 adult I.C. (EPSDT fee recorded). Fees printed in whole dollars. An adult annual benefit maximum (Dental Bulletin 58, eff. 2026-08-01) was reported by search but not verified here. mass.gov 'download' links first serve an ADA CDT license page; the actual file is the linked /files/documents/ URL. mass.gov returns 403 to browser User-Agents; fetched with curl's default UA.",
